  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The kinetic energy and the momentum of a moving object are related by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the ratio of the&nbsp;kinetic energies of two objects having masses&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;can be calculated as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Substitute the ratio of the kinetic energies into equation (2) and simplify to obtain the ratio of their masses.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>m</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
